{"title":"The Japanese Salaryman Eraser Goes Bald Through Use","link":"https://kottke.org/25/01/japanese-salaryman-eraser-goes-bald","date":1738357648000,"content":"\n        <p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/salaryman-eraser.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/salaryman-eraser.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/salaryman-eraser.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"958\" alt=\"two views of an eraser of a man, one unused with a full head of 'hair' and the other where the eraser has been used and the man is going bald\" /></p>\n\n<p>Designed by <a href=\"https://ishikawakazuya.net/\">Kazuya Ishikawa</a>, the clever <a href=\"https://papermoonisland.com/products/salaryman-erasers\">Salaryman Eraser</a> features a Japanese businessman who goes bald as you use the eraser. The same company also makes <a href=\"https://papermoonisland.com/products/mount-fuji-eraser\">an eraser that turns into Mt Fuji</a> through repeated use.</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/design\">design</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Kazuya%20Ishikawa\">Kazuya Ishikawa</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/01/japanese-salaryman-eraser-goes-bald\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"f7cc65ee0d90ae0448bb50b8030e09e6be2c76ba3927db82f76ead991e82d875","category":"Sites"}